---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Aura: Looksmaxxing" description="Aura helps you explore your features, hairstyle options and everyday styling goals through photo-based AI reports.">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16"><h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black">About Aura</h1><div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-[#aaa] leading-relaxed">
    <p>Aura is a collection of photo-based tools for exploring your appearance and styling preferences. Start with face analysis, find haircut ideas, compare photographs or build a four-week glow-up plan.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-bold">Start with a useful question</h2><p>Choose a tool and upload a clear photo. You can add preferences such as hair length, maintenance time or your preferred style. The AI uses the photo and those preferences to create a report. Dedicated options for women focus on feminine styling without assuming that everyone has the same goals.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-bold">Preview first</h2><p>You can see a styling-potential estimate without an account. The detailed report stays locked until you save it to an account and unlock it for $2.99 once. Subscriptions are optional for people who want ongoing credits for reports and hairstyle try-ons.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-bold">How to interpret a result</h2><p>Aura gives subjective AI observations. Lighting, pose, image quality and styling preferences affect the report. The estimates are not calibrated physical measurements, scientific attractiveness ratings, diagnoses or promises about future results.</p>
    <h2 class="text-2xl text-white font-bold">Your photos</h2><p>Photos are sent to AI processing services to produce your result. The public upload tools do not save the original photos in Aura's report database. Other app features can save photos and generated images in your account. Our <a href="/privacy" class="text-fuchsia-300">privacy policy</a> describes these differences.</p>
    <p><a href="/tools" class="text-fuchsia-300 font-bold">Explore the tools →</a></p><p>Questions? <a href="mailto:support@aura-looksmaxxing.com" class="text-fuchsia-300">Contact support</a>.</p>
  </div></article>
</BaseLayout>
